y Fox</strong> and lead an investigation that gradually shifts from an intimate film noir into oppressive Lovecraftian horror. Driven by memorable characters and revelations that will linger long after the credits roll, <i>Echoes</i> delivers a taut narrative where every discovery matters and leads to <strong>four distinct endings</strong> shaped by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But hurry \u2014 it may already be too late\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775220/extras/55496d0bf08a0bf7f4f68f35eaf9375b.poster.avif?t=1770136250\" width=492 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775220/extras/55496d0bf08a0bf7f4f68f35eaf9375b.webm?t=1770136250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775220/extras/55496d0bf08a0bf7f4f68f35eaf9375b.mp4?t=1770136250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search scenes rich with clues, confront mysterious witnesses, and steer the investigation as you wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple point-and-click system that reinforces the detective feel and pushes you to become the protagonist of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision alters relationships, opening or closing leads and triggering tangible consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True replayability: explore different paths to reveal the full extent of the mystery, with multiple possible endings depending on your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775220/extras/57d60b27d57f432e8a6f1dfbd7acc97a.poster.avif